@post_election
on-arrival: {!
// set congress proportion to votes
Q.spd_r = Q.spd_votes;
Q.epp_r = Q.epp_votes;
Q.left_r = Q.left_votes;
Q.green_r = Q.green_votes;
Q.renew_r = Q.renew_votes;
Q.esn_r = Q.esn_votes;
Q.acc_r = Q.acc_votes;
Q.other_r = Q.other_votes;

// The largest party can only be the ACC or the SPD.
Q.largest_party = 'SPD';
if (Q.acc_r >= Q.spd_r && Q.acc_r >= Q.left_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'Accelerationists';
}
if (Q.left_r >= Q.spd_r && Q.left_r >= Q.acc_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'Left';
}

// coalitions
Q.weimar_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.green_r + Q.epp_r - 3;
Q.grand_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.green_r + Q.epp_r + Q.renew_r;
Q.bourgeois_coalition = Q.green_r + Q.epp_r + Q.renew_r + Q.other_r;
Q.center_right_coalition = Q.epp_r + Q.green_r + Q.renew_r + Q.other_r + Q.esn_r;
Q.right_coalition = Q.epp_r + Q.renew_r + Q.other_r + Q.esn_r;
Q.far_right_coalition = Q.esn_r + Q.acc_r;
Q.left_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.left_r;
// this is an absurd concept lol
Q.united_front_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.left_r + Q.epp_r + Q.green_r - 3;
Q.anti_democratic_coalition = Q.left_r + Q.acc_r;
// aka everyone except nazi, kpd, dnvp
Q.neo_weimar_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.green_r + Q.epp_r + Q.renew_r + Q.other_r;
!}

The electoral system is essentially proportional, with the proportion of Reichstag seats roughly equal to the proportion of votes.
 
**Election results:**

# 1928: 30, 1930: 25, 1932: 22
SPD: [+ spd_r +]

# 1928: 15, 1930: 15, 1932: 
EPP: [+ epp_r +]

# 1928: 10, 1930: 13
Left: [+ left_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 4 (as DstP)
Greens: [+ green_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 5
Renew: [+ renew_r +]

# 1928: 14, 1930: 7
ESN: [+ esn_r +]

# 1928: 3, 1930: 18
ACC: [+ acc_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 10
Other: [+ other_r +]

**Potential coalitions:**

Weimar Coalition (SPD + EPP + Greens): [+ weimar_coalition +]

Grand Coalition (SPD + EPP + Greens + Renew): [+ grand_coalition +]

Bourgeois Coalition (EPP +  Greens + Renew + Others): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]

Right-wing Coalition (EPP + DVP + Others + ESN): [+ right_coalition +]

